---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navigation from '../../components/Navigation.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/sections/PageHero.astro';
import FAQSection from '../../components/sections/FAQSection.astro';
import FinalCTA from '../../components/FinalCTA.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';

const breadcrumbs = [
  { label: 'Home', href: '/' },
  { label: 'Industries', href: '/industries/' },
  { label: 'Public Sector', href: '/industries/public-sector/' },
];

const faqItems = [
  {
    question: 'How does sovereign AI work for government agencies?',
    answer: 'In our public sector setup, AI processing runs on infrastructure in Germany: on-premise in your data center or on dedicated Hetzner servers in Germany. Data is not sent to US cloud providers or external AI services. We use open-weight models that your IT security team can inspect, which supports transparency and reduces vendor lock-in.',
  },
  {
    question: 'Can the AI handle citizen inquiries in multiple languages?',
    answer: 'Yes. Our chatbot solutions support German, English, and other European languages. They can be configured for multilingual citizen services, automatically detecting the language of inquiry and responding accordingly, all processed locally on your infrastructure.',
  },
  {
    question: 'What open-source models do you use?',
    answer: 'We deploy open-weight LLMs whose models and configuration your IT security team can inspect. This reduces the "black box" concern with proprietary AI services and supports transparency requirements in public procurement. Specific model selection depends on your use case and infrastructure capacity.',
  },
  {
    question: 'How does this compare to existing government AI initiatives in Europe?',
    answer: 'Public administrations across Europe are piloting AI, and citizen service chatbots are among the most common use cases. Sovereign infrastructure, built for GDPR requirements, can help build citizen trust in these services.',
  },
  {
    question: 'What is the procurement process for public sector AI?',
    answer: 'We work within standard public procurement frameworks and can support both direct procurement under threshold values and formal tender processes. Our solutions use open-source and open-weight components, which helps with common procurement requirements around vendor independence and long-term sustainability.',
  },
];

const structuredData = [
  {
    "@type": "Service",
    "@id": "https://ironum.com/industries/public-sector/#service",
    "name": "Public Sector AI Solutions",
    "description": "Sovereign AI on German infrastructure for government agencies. Citizen service automation, document processing, and internal knowledge management, hosted in Germany.",
    "url": "https://ironum.com/industries/public-sector/",
    "provider": { "@id": "https://ironum.com/#organization" },
    "areaServed": { "@type": "Place", "name": "Europe" },
    "serviceType": "AI Infrastructure for Public Sector"
  },
  {
    "@type": "FAQPage",
    "mainEntity": faqItems.map(item => ({
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": item.question,
      "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": item.answer }
    }))
  }
];
---

<Layout
  title="Public Sector AI - Sovereign AI on German Infrastructure | Ironum"
  description="Sovereign AI for European government agencies. Citizen service automation, document processing, and knowledge management. Hosted in Germany, built on open models."
  breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}
  structuredData={structuredData}
>
  <Navigation />
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="AI FOR PUBLIC SECTOR"
    title="Sovereign AI on German Infrastructure"
    subtitle="Deploy citizen-facing and internal AI on infrastructure hosted in Germany, built on models your IT team can inspect."
  />

  <!-- Challenges Section -->
  <section class="px-4 md:px-20 py-20 md:py-32">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <span class="text-orange-500 font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-sm uppercase">The challenge</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold mt-4">Government AI Needs Digital Sovereignty</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-lg font-semibold mt-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Public sector AI faces specific constraints: citizen data protection, procurement regulations, transparency requirements, and a strong preference for sovereign infrastructure.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="border-2 border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-8">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-red-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-red-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 21v-4m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6.5l1 1H21l-3 6 3 6h-8.5l-1-1H5a2 2 0 00-2 2zm6-11h.01M9 5h.01" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Digital Sovereignty Mandate</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500">Many public bodies want to avoid processing government data with US-based cloud providers that are subject to the CLOUD Act. Digital sovereignty is a stated goal of German and European public administration.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-2 border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-8">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-red-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-red-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Citizen Service Backlog</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500">Government agencies face growing citizen expectations for digital services while struggling with staffing shortages and manual processes. Chatbots are among the most common public sector AI use cases, but many run on infrastructure outside the agency's control.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-2 border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-8">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-red-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-red-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Transparency & Auditability</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500">Public sector AI should be explainable, auditable, and free from vendor lock-in. Proprietary models make this harder to show. Inspectable models and audit trails help build public trust.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Solutions Section -->
  <section class="px-4 md:px-20 py-20 md:py-32 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <span class="text-orange-500 font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-sm uppercase">Solutions</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold mt-4">Open-Source AI for Government</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-lg font-semibold mt-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto">A German-hosted AI stack built on open-weight models. No US cloud providers in the chain and no proprietary lock-in.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="bg-white border-2 border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-8">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-blue-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 10h.01M12 10h.01M16 10h.01M9 16H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h14a2 2 0 012 2v8a2 2 0 01-2 2h-5l-5 5v-5z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Citizen Service Chatbot</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 mb-4">AI-powered citizen service assistant that answers questions about government services, permits, regulations, and procedures. Deployed on German infrastructure with multilingual support.</p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-500 text-sm">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-blue-600 mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>24/7 availability for citizen inquiries</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-blue-600 mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>Configured with your agency's specific services</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-blue-600 mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>German and multilingual support</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white border-2 border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-8">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-blue-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Document Processing</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 mb-4">Automated processing, classification, and extraction of government documents. Reduce manual handling of applications, permits, and correspondence with AI-powered workflow automation.</p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-500 text-sm">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-blue-600 mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>Automated document classification and routing</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-blue-600 mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>Data extraction from forms and applications</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-blue-600 mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>n8n workflow automation for processing chains</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white border-2 border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-8">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-blue-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Internal Knowledge Base</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 mb-4">RAG-powered internal assistant for government employees. Instant access to regulations, procedures, and institutional knowledge, reducing onboarding time and improving service consistency.</p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-500 text-sm">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-blue-600 mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>Natural language search across your policies</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-blue-600 mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>Source-cited answers for accountability</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-blue-600 mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>Open-weight models your IT team can inspect</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Sovereign Infrastructure -->
  <section class="px-4 md:px-20 py-20 md:py-32">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
        <div>
          <span class="text-orange-500 font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-sm uppercase">Sovereign infrastructure</span>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold mt-4 mb-6">Built for Government Trust</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-lg font-semibold mb-6">Every component of our public sector AI stack is designed for sovereignty, transparency, and public accountability.</p>
          <ul class="space-y-4">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-600 mt-1 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span class="text-gray-600"><strong>German-hosted:</strong> Hetzner data centers in Germany, no US CLOUD Act exposure</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-600 mt-1 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span class="text-gray-600"><strong>Open models:</strong> Models your IT team can inspect, no proprietary black boxes</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-600 mt-1 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span class="text-gray-600"><strong>No vendor lock-in:</strong> Open standards and portable deployments</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-600 mt-1 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span class="text-gray-600"><strong>EU AI Act support:</strong> Technical documentation and risk management support; the legal classification stays with your legal team</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div class="border-2 border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center">
            <div class="text-blue-600 text-4xl font-bold mb-2">DE</div>
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm font-semibold">hosted in German data centers</p>
          </div>
          <div class="border-2 border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center">
            <div class="text-blue-600 text-4xl font-bold mb-2">Open</div>
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm font-semibold">models your IT team can inspect</p>
          </div>
          <div class="border-2 border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center">
            <div class="text-blue-600 text-4xl font-bold mb-2">Sources</div>
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm font-semibold">cited in answers for accountability</p>
          </div>
          <div class="border-2 border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center">
            <div class="text-blue-600 text-4xl font-bold mb-2">Exit</div>
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm font-semibold">portable deployments, no proprietary lock-in</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Related Services -->
  <section class="px-4 md:px-20 py-20 md:py-32 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto space-y-8">
      <span class="text-orange-500 font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-sm uppercase block">RELATED SERVICES</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold">Solutions That Power Public Sector AI</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <a href="/services/chatbot-interfaces/" class="border-2 border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-8 bg-white hover:border-blue-200 transition-colors group">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Chatbot Interfaces</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 font-semibold mb-4">Multilingual citizen service chatbots deployed on sovereign German infrastructure for 24/7 availability.</p>
          <span class="text-blue-600 font-semibold inline-flex items-center gap-1 group-hover:gap-2 transition-all">Learn more <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></span>
        </a>
        <a href="/services/workflow-automation/" class="border-2 border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-8 bg-white hover:border-blue-200 transition-colors group">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Workflow Automation</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 font-semibold mb-4">Automate document processing, permit applications, and interdepartmental workflows with self-hosted n8n.</p>
          <span class="text-blue-600 font-semibold inline-flex items-center gap-1 group-hover:gap-2 transition-all">Learn more <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></span>
        </a>
        <a href="/services/enterprise-rag/" class="border-2 border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-8 bg-white hover:border-blue-200 transition-colors group">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Enterprise RAG</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 font-semibold mb-4">Internal knowledge bases for government employees with instant access to regulations, procedures, and policies.</p>
          <span class="text-blue-600 font-semibold inline-flex items-center gap-1 group-hover:gap-2 transition-all">Learn more <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <FAQSection items={faqItems} />
  <aside class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 my-10 text-sm text-gray-600">
    <p class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 px-6 py-4"><strong class="font-semibold text-gray-700">Note:</strong> This page is for general information only and does not constitute legal, tax, or data-protection advice. Ironum is a technical service provider, not a law firm. For an assessment of your specific situation, please consult your own qualified legal counsel or data protection officer.</p>
  </aside>
  <FinalCTA />
  <Footer />
</Layout>
